  "root_node": "model.stg_orders",
  "cause": "code_change",
  "action": "patch",
  "evidence": "The freshness test `assert_orders_fresh` fails because the `_loaded_at` timestamps in `raw.orders` (and thus in `stg_orders`) range from 1992 to 1998, far older than any reasonable freshness threshold. The SQL of `stg_orders` simply propagates the source `_loaded_at` column without modification, so the model is correct. The failure is due to the test configuration expecting recent ingestion timestamps on a static TPCH dataset. Adjusting the test's freshness threshold or column selection (patching the test) resolves the issue without altering data."
}
